ness_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FCcFpitB7F3qxd1bD4Epfg","review_id":"hpcQ_dEH4sbOwVb5k8n97A","date":"2020-09-08T20:19:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9054162502288818,"text_excerpt":"Excellent food! What I've always wanted - high quality takeout and a place that cuts the fuss out of having a \"dining experience\". There is already plenty of that on the New Orleans scene (which takes itself a little too seriously and is often a huge expense and hassle). Apparently the chef here was trained in some of the top restaurants here, and it shows. Yum!"},{"business_id":"FCcFpitB7F3qxd1bD4Epfg","review_id":"rm3nlIaZxLi2trKInBa7ow","date":"2017-12-14T01:12:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9013127088546753,"text_excerpt":"We stopped into this take-out place and were greeted warmly. We looked at the menu and asked how spicy the sweet heat tacos are. We were offered a taste and the meat was delicious. We ordered the tacos and bought a bottle of \"Bob's Sweet Heat\" sauce as well. Excellent! A great dinner!! I am sure I'll be back to try more of their specials. There's also a refrigerator case with dips and spreads that sound awesome. Can't wait to get back there!"},{"business_id":"FCcFpitB7F3qxd1bD4Epfg","review_id":"Y_7rfNLB62oDfPlT4VMLhg","date":"2018-10-06T19:47:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8990264534950256,"text_excerpt":"New place for me. Bob Iacovone puts a lot of love and passion into his craft and the food smells and tastes over the top! The moment you walk in you are surprised by the pleasant aroma of a well orchestrated menu! The menu is simple to read and I made a quick decision to try the Mexican bowl while my girlfriend got the Farmers Market. She got chicken and quinoa and I took the pork with rice and neither were disappointed! Fresh mozzarella was tried as well and I can't put into words the flavor! Affordable and I'm well fed. I'll definitely be back for more!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
